<section v-else-if="route.path==='/research'" class="section container content-page"><div class="section-top"><div><div class="eyebrow">RESEARCH & TRAINING</div><h2>让机器人平台服务科研与人才培养</h2></div><p class="section-intro">面向高校、科研机构与实验室，提供从课题设计到实机验证的支持。</p></div><div class="feature-split"><div class="feature-copy"><span class="pill">RESEARCH SUPPORT</span><h2>科研支持贯穿完整实验流程</h2><p>基于大圣机器人与 EI-Stack，支持数据采集、模型训练、部署验证、自主导航和双臂操作研究，也可围绕视觉语言动作模型、世界模型与虚实迁移开展课题合作。</p><div class="feature-list"><span>定制科研课题</span><span>仿真环境搭建</span><span>数据与模型支持</span><span>真机部署验证</span></div><router-link to="/contact" class="btn primary">咨询科研合作 <ArrowUpRight :size="17"/></router-link></div><img :src="imgs.lab" alt="具身智能科研实验室示意"/></div><div id="directions" class="section-top spaced"><div><div class="eyebrow">RESEARCH DIRECTIONS</div><h2>重点研究方向</h2></div></div><div class="research-grid"><article v-for="r in researchDirections" :key="r.num"><span>{{r.num}}</span><h3>{{r.title}}</h3><p>{{r.desc}}</p></article></div><div id="training" class="training-band"><div><div class="eyebrow light">EDUCATION & TRAINING</div><h2>教学与实训体系</h2><p>覆盖整机拆装、分层部署、ROS2、仿真系统、LeRobot、数据采集和实机任务。可配套课程体系、教材课件、实验指导、教学视频与师资培训。</p></div><div class="training-results"><span>课程建设</span><span>实训项目</span><span>竞赛实践</span><span>人才培养</span></div></div><div class="source-hint">当前为官网内容演示，具体科研项目与合作成果可在后续材料确认后替换。</div></section>
